        "chars": 205,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 5.84
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        331,
        2123,
        1956,
        2587
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Vehicular Control Board will consist of three members -- the Deputy Mayor, the Commissioner of Public Works and the Commissioner of Purchase. The Budget Director, through his bureau's Automotive Analysis Unit, and the Deputy Mayor -- City Administrator will sit as non-voting members of the Vehicular Control Board. Agency heads are instructed to address any requests for information to the Vehicular Control Board, the Department of Public Works, Municipal Building, New York, New York 10007.",
